{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Corvo addition: a guide to the site for AI assistants, in plain text (the "llms.txt" convention, llmstxt.org).

  It is written from the shop's own data, so it never falls out of date: the rugs, the materials, the craft levels,
  the prices and the rules are read as the page is served. The rules come from the theme settings ("Corvo: prices and
  rules") through the "corvo-fill" and "corvo-fact" snippets, like every other page.

  To publish it, create a page that uses this template and redirect /llms.txt to it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rugs = collections.all.products
  assign sample = all_products['rug-sample']
  assign vat_percent = settings.rug_vat_percent | default: 23
  assign vat_plus = vat_percent | plus: 100

  capture fx
    render 'rug-fx'
  endcapture
-%}
# Corvo

> {% render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'description' %}

## Key facts

- Who: Corvo, a maker of bespoke and made-to-order rugs in {{ 'general.corvo.locality' | t }}, Portugal. Part of the {{ 'general.corvo.parent' | t }} Group.
- What: {{ collections.all.products_count }} rug designs in six collections. Every rug is hand-tufted to order in Portugal.
- Sizes: each design comes in five standard sizes, and is made to measure in any size up to {% render 'corvo-fill', text: '[max_size]' %}.
- Materials: {% render 'corvo-fill', text: '[materials_count] materials. [materials_standard] are included in the price; [materials_plus] add a supplement; [materials_premium] are premium fibres.' %}
- Colours: every colour of a design can be changed, {% render 'corvo-fill', text: 'to one of the [palette_count] colours of the Open Palette at no extra cost, or to any custom colour for [colour_price] per colour.' %}
- Prices: shown on each rug page in the shop's currency, VAT of {{ vat_percent }}% included. A made-to-measure price is calculated on the rug page from the price per m² of the design. {% render 'corvo-fill', text: 'A design of your own starts at [from_price] per m².' %}
{% if sample.available %}- Samples: {% render 'corvo-fill', text: 'a [sample_size] sample of any rug costs [sample_price].' %}
{% endif %}- Lead time: {% render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'lead_time' %}.
- Delivery: worldwide. {% render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'delivery' %}.
- Orders: {% render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'orders' %}. {% render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'defects' %}.
- Returns: {% render 'corvo-fact', fact: 'returns' %}.
- Website: {{ shop.url }}

