## Price guide for a bespoke rug

The price per m² follows the craft level of the design, which measures how demanding the design is to make. Prices per m² with VAT, and without VAT in brackets:

{% for level in shop.metaobjects.craft_level.values -%}
{%- liquid
  assign level_net = level.retail_per_m2.value | times: 100 | round
  assign level_gross = level.retail_per_m2.value | times: vat_plus | round
-%}
- Craft level {{ level.label.value }}: {{ level.description.value | downcase }}; colours: {{ level.colours.value }}; {% render 'rug-money', amount: level_gross, fx: fx %} per m² ({% render 'rug-money', amount: level_net, fx: fx %}).
{% endfor %}
What adds to the price per m²:

{% for material in shop.metaobjects.rug_material.values -%}
{%- unless material.group.value == 'Standard' -%}
- Material {{ material.name.value }}: {{ material.supplement.value }}.
{% endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{% render 'corvo-fill', text: '- A rug under [small_area] m²: +[small_percent]%.' %}
{% render 'corvo-fill', text: '- A rug over [large_size]: +[large_percent]%.' %}
{% render 'corvo-fill', text: '- A pile above [pile_limit] mm: +[pile_percent]%.' %}
{% render 'corvo-fill', text: '- Carving: +[carving_percent]%.' %}
{% render 'corvo-fill', text: '- Round corners: +[corners_percent]%.' %}
{% render 'corvo-fill', text: '- Each custom colour: [colour_price].' %}
{% render 'corvo-fill', text: '- Priority production, in [priority_weeks] weeks instead of [lead_weeks]: +[priority_percent]% on the whole price.' %}

