## Design library

{% render 'corvo-fill', text: 'The design library holds [design_count] designs. Each is the starting point of a bespoke rug: Corvo draws it again in the size, the colours and the materials asked for, up to [max_size], and its price follows the price guide above.' %} The designs, by style:

{% paginate shop.metaobjects.rug_design.values by 250 -%}
{%- liquid
  assign library_check = '|'

  for design in shop.metaobjects.rug_design.values
    assign library_style = design.style.value | default: 'Other'
    assign library_needle = library_style | append: '|' | prepend: '|'

    unless library_check contains library_needle
      assign library_check = library_check | append: library_style | append: '|'
    endunless
  endfor

  assign library_styles = library_check | split: '|'
-%}
{%- for library_style in library_styles -%}
{%- liquid
  if library_style == blank
    continue
  endif

  assign library_names = ''

  for design in shop.metaobjects.rug_design.values
    assign design_style = design.style.value | default: 'Other'

    if design_style == library_style
      assign library_names = library_names | append: design.name.value | append: '|'
    endif
  endfor

  assign library_names = library_names | split: '|' | join: ', '
-%}
- {{ library_style }}: {{ library_names }}.
{% endfor -%}
{%- endpaginate -%}
{% comment %}The projects of the Portfolio. An example project (ticked "Preview only") is never listed here.{% endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign project_lines = ''
  assign project_separator = '<!--project-->'
  assign project_key_separator = '<!--key-->'

  for project in shop.metaobjects.project.values
    if project.example.value
      continue
    endif

    assign project_facts = ''

    if project.space.value != blank
      assign project_facts = project_facts | append: project.space.value | downcase | append: '|'
    endif

    if project.location.value != blank
      assign project_facts = project_facts | append: project.location.value | append: '|'
    endif

    if project.year.value != blank
      assign project_facts = project_facts | append: project.year.value | append: '|'
    endif

    if project.designer.value != blank
      assign project_facts = project_facts | append: 'design by ' | append: project.designer.value | append: '|'
    endif

    assign project_rugs = project.rugs.value | map: 'title' | join: ', '

    if project_rugs != blank
      assign project_facts = project_facts | append: 'rugs: ' | append: project_rugs | append: '|'
    endif

    assign project_facts = project_facts | split: '|' | join: '; '

    capture project_key
      render 'project-key', project: project
    endcapture

    assign project_key = project_key | strip
    assign project_line = '- [' | append: project.title.value | append: '](' | append: shop.url | append: project.system.url | append: ')'

    if project_facts != blank
      assign project_line = project_line | append: ': ' | append: project_facts | append: '.'
    endif

    assign project_lines = project_lines | append: project_key | append: project_key_separator | append: project_line | append: project_separator
  endfor

  assign sorted_projects = project_lines | split: project_separator | sort
-%}
{%- if sorted_projects.size > 0 %}
## Projects

Projects with Corvo rugs, from the Portfolio:

{% for project_line in sorted_projects -%}
{{ project_line | split: project_key_separator | last }}
{% endfor -%}
{%- endif %}
## Rugs

{% for rug in rugs -%}
{%- liquid
  assign craft = rug.metafields.rug.craft_level.value
  if craft == blank
    continue
  endif
  assign materials = rug.metafields.rug.materials.value | map: 'name' | map: 'value' | join: ', '
  assign own_factor = rug.metafields.rug.supplement.value | default: 0 | plus: 100 | divided_by: 100.0
  assign per_m2 = craft.retail_per_m2.value | times: own_factor | times: vat_plus | round
-%}
- [{{ rug.title }}]({{ shop.url }}{{ rug.url }}): craft level {{ craft.label.value }}{% if materials != blank %}; {{ materials }}{% endif %}{% if rug.metafields.rug.pile_height.value != blank %}; pile {{ rug.metafields.rug.pile_height.value | downcase }}{% endif %}; standard sizes from {{ rug.price_min | money }} to {{ rug.price_max | money }}; made to measure at {% render 'rug-money', amount: per_m2, fx: fx %} per m², VAT included.
{% endfor %}
